02","subskill":"speaker_intention","difficulty":4,"taskType":"multiple_choice","questionType":"listening","prompt":"What is Tom''s attitude to using the system again?","options":["He thinks only younger visitors should be allowed to use it.","He is generally in favour but wants practical improvements.","He will use it again without changing anything.","He has decided the experiment was a complete failure."],"answer":"He is generally in favour but wants practical improvements.","answerKey":"B","rubric":null,"sourceMaterial":null,"responseConstraints":null,"primaryEvidence":null,"taskletPosition":4,"bankVersion":"pilot-0.5","qualityStatus":"approved_for_pilot","psychometricStatus":"uncalibrated"},{"externalId":"L-B2-001-Q1","level":"B2","skill":"listening","category":"Listening","topic":"work","genre":"interview","audience":"adult","taskletExternalId":"L-B2-001","subskill":"main_argument","difficulty":4,"taskType":"multiple_choice","questionType":"listening","prompt":"What problem was the policy mainly designed to address?","options":["work time being broken into many short periods","different time zones making meetings impossible to schedule","staff spending too much time working alone","employees refusing to attend necessary client meetings"],"answer":"work time being broken into many short periods","answerKey":"A","rubric":null,"sourceMaterial":null,"responseConstraints":null,"primaryEvidence":null,"taskletPosition":1,"bankVersion":"pilot-0.5","qualityStatus":"approved_for_pilot","psychometricStatus":"uncalibrated"},{"externalId":"L-B2-001-Q2","level":"B2","skill":"listening","category":"Listening","topic":"work","genre":"interview","audience":"adult","taskletExternalId":"L-B2-001","subskill":"speaker_attitude","difficulty":4,"taskType":"multiple_choice","questionType":"listening","prompt":"How does the manager respond to the claim that productivity increased?","options":["negatively, because staff surveys show no improvement","enthusiastically, because company dat